<title>USA: Indiana Energy Inc Q4 Sept 30 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Indiana Energy Inc Q4 Sept 30 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended September 30</p>
<p>							  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Utility Operating Revenues		   $62,521     $57,199</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)				(5,928)     (4,218)</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) Per Average		    (.27)	 (.19)</p>
<p>Common Share</p>
<p> Average Common Shares			   22,474	22,562</p>
<p>		   (In Thousands Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income (loss) for the three-month period ended September 30 is not indicative of net income (loss) for an annual period because of the seasonal sales of gas for space heating purposes.</p>
